# Plan: Epic decomposition

Decompose only recognized Epic. For each proposed Story, Task, or existing Bug show parent, objective, scope, acceptance, dependencies/order, linked artifacts, estimate uncertainty, non-goals. Small Epics may use direct Tasks/Bugs; classify unnecessary Stories Not needed.

Confirm every entity and relationship before mutation. Reuse existing issues; never turn interpretation into Bug. Verify results and reflect exact IDs in executable plan.
